{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812620/extras/4adccf76ba710fcc23c229ccf469775a.poster.avif?t=1767005266\" width=254 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812620/extras/4adccf76ba710fcc23c229ccf469775a.webm?t=1767005266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812620/extras/4adccf76ba710fcc23c229ccf469775a.mp4?t=1767005266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is this game?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Brain School you have to discover a code, which is made up of cards. The cards used are from a standard 52 card deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812620/extras/275105694d9c19c1a589543d47c227f6.avif?t=1767005266\" width=240 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find the code by asking questions such as</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<i>Where is the card with the lowest value?</i>&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<i>What is the sum of all the spades cards?</i>&quot;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asking questions cost 'clues', which you have a limited amount of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you find the code you can transform the remaining clues into new rules for the next rounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812620/extras/bdcc29f07e8bc57d9c54bb2bdef4cde9.avif?t=1767005266\" width=426 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The questions will rarely give you a direct answer to one of the cards, instead you will need your logic and deduction skills to figure out what each card is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812620/extras/becc504867093371e2eb77b7486624cf.gif?t=1767005266\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812620/extras/becc504867093371e2eb77b7486624cf.poster.avif?t=1767005266\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The next round will have more cards in the code, so it will be more difficult to find the code. Reach and solve the final round to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple levels/game modes with different mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5-7 rounds per game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~1 hour per game depending on the size of your brain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~30 different rules to get that modify your run, making each run different</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tutorial that holds your hand like a baby and explains the game (you can skip the tutorial if you want)</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"1st Grade","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3812620/7fe9080570052159116b3d7530bf4ca397d7d254.jpg"},{"name":"Hexam Exam","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3812620/7fe9080570052159116b3d7530bf4ca397d7d254.jpg"},{"name":"Teacher's Pet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3812620/4926bc767b3f89605b8513b2e4c90153cee67378.jpg"},{"name":"Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3812620/4926bc767b3f89605b8513b2e4c90153cee67378.jpg"},{"name":"Cum Laude","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3812620/7f9479cb344b46efca6d3aa2188a6ec58f857301.jpg"},{"name":"Overachiever","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3812620/7f9479cb344b46efca6d3aa2188a6ec58f857301.jpg"},{"name":"Lightning Round","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3812620/4926bc767b3f89605b8513b2e4c90153cee67378.jpg"},{"name":"With Honors","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3812620/7f9479cb344b46efca6d3aa2188a6ec58f857301.jpg"},{"name":"Pure Genius","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3812620/7f9479cb344b46efca6d3aa2188a6ec58f857301.jpg"},{"name":"Graduated","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3812620/852bbd42838250dfd9f8f1f6e6e1a40d6aeb4bfd.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3812620?t=1767005266","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812620/3ad73ec9ecc37445735d4342fe61f5e11de73e01/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767005266","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812620/26c9f0662c2f262bb4edf948dd22d95fe97c7df5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767005266","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812620/26c9f0662c2f262bb4edf948dd22d95fe97c7df5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767005266","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812620/extras/4adccf76ba710fcc23c229ccf469775a.poster.avif?t=1767005266\" width=254 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812620/extras/4adccf76ba710fcc23c229ccf469775a.webm?t=1767005266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812620/extras/4adccf76ba710fcc23c229ccf469775a.mp4?t=1767005266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is this game?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Brain School you have to discover a code, which is made up of cards. The cards used are from a standard 52 card deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812620/extras/275105694d9c19c1a589543d47c227f6.avif?t=1767005266\" width=240 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find the code by asking questions such as</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<i>Where is the card with the lowest value?</i>&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<i>What is the sum of all the spades cards?</i>&quot;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asking questions cost 'clues', which you have a limited amount of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you find the code you can transform the remaining clues into new rules for the next rounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812620/extras/bdcc29f07e8bc57d9c54bb2bdef4cde9.avif?t=1767005266\" width=426 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The questions will rarely give you a direct answer to one of the cards, instead you will need your logic and deduction skills to figure out what each card is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812620/extras/becc504867093371e2eb77b7486624cf.gif?t=1767005266\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812620/extras/becc504867093371e2eb77b7486624cf.poster.avif?t=1767005266\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The next round will have more cards in the code, so it will be more difficult to find the code. Reach and solve the final round to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple levels/game modes with different mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5-7 rounds per game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~1 hour per game depending on the size of your brain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~30 different rules to get that modify your run, making each run different</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tutorial that holds your hand like a baby and explains the game (you can skip the tutorial if you want)</p></li></ul>","developers":["Sokpop Collective"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812620/e8fabbe3b5e970ee3476f77cd4115482341c1b94/header.jpg?t=1767005266","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OSX 10.9<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Only<br></li><li><str